{
  "_comment": [
    "Service registry for the launcher. Edited by hand; read at every request.",
    "HOST in a url is substituted at runtime with this node's MagicDNS name,",
    "so the file stays tailnet-agnostic and survives a re-tailnet.",
    "marker  - a path that exists only after that service is deployed. Drives",
    "          'installed' without touching the docker CLI (a systemd user unit",
    "          does not reliably inherit the docker group; status must not",
    "          depend on that).",
    "setup   - path to setup.sh relative to the repo root, or an absolute /",
    "          ~-prefixed path for service code that lives outside this repo.",
    "          null means 'not built yet' -> planned.",
    "Order here is the order the grid renders in: daily drivers first."
  ],
  "services": [
    {
      "key": "immich",
      "name": "Immich",
      "tagline": "Photos",
      "icon": "camera",
      "url": "https://HOST:2283/",
      "health": "http://127.0.0.1:2283/api/server/ping",
      "marker": "~/services/immich",
      "setup": "immich/setup.sh"
    },
    {
      "key": "seafile",
      "name": "Seafile",
      "tagline": "Files",
      "icon": "folder",
      "url": "https://HOST:8443/",
      "health": "http://127.0.0.1:8081/api2/ping/",
      "marker": "~/services/seafile",
      "setup": "seafile/setup.sh"
    },
    {
      "key": "code-server",
      "name": "code-server",
      "tagline": "Code",
      "icon": "code",
      "url": "https://HOST/",
      "health": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/healthz",
      "marker": "~/.config/code-server",
      "setup": "code-server/setup.sh"
    },
    {
      "key": "open-webui",
      "name": "Open WebUI",
